---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Jeff Smolinski"
  description="What jeffallan.github.io collects, which services it uses, and how to opt out."
>
  <Navbar />

  <div class="container-fluid pt-5 pl-5 pr-5">
    <div class="card privacy">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Effective:</strong> October 26, 2026</p>

        <p>
          This policy covers <code>https://jeffallan.github.io/</code>, Jeff Smolinski's personal
          site. The project documentation sites under it have their own policies: <a
            href="/claude-skills/privacy/">Claude Skills</a
          > and <a href="/writing-with-agents/privacy/">Writing With Agents</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What the site uses</h2>
        <p>The site is static. It has no accounts and no database, and it uses these services:</p>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Service</th><th>What it's for</th><th>What it receives</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>GitHub Pages</td>
              <td>Hosting</td>
              <td>
                Your IP address, in standard server logs. <a
                  href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
                  >GitHub's privacy statement</a
                > applies.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Google Analytics 4 (<code>G-QS4KFCN3S4</code>)</td>
              <td>Counting visits and page views</td>
              <td>
                Cookies, the page address, the referring page, approximate location from your IP
                address, and browser and device details. <a
                  href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a
                > applies.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Google Fonts</td>
              <td>Loading the site's fonts</td>
              <td>
                Your IP address and browser details, when the font files load. <a
                  href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a
                > applies.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Formspree</td>
              <td>Delivering messages sent with the contact form</td>
              <td>
                The name, email address, topic and message you enter, and the page you sent it
                from. <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/"
                  >Formspree's privacy policy</a
                > applies.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>shields.io, pepy.tech, awesome.re</td>
              <td>The badge images on the project cards</td>
              <td>Your IP address and browser details, when the images load.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2>Opting out of analytics</h2>
        <p>
          The <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>
          or any ad or tracker blocker stops the analytics. The site works the same with them on.
        </p>

        <h2>Messages you send</h2>
        <p>
          A message sent through the contact form reaches Jeff by email through Formspree. It is
          used to reply to you and for nothing else. To have a message deleted, ask through the
          same form.
        </p>

        <h2>Sale of personal information</h2>
        <p>The site doesn't sell, rent or trade personal information.</p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          The site isn't directed at children under 13, or the minimum age where you live, and
          doesn't knowingly collect information from them.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>A changed policy will be published at this address with a new effective date.</p>

        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>Send privacy questions and requests through the <a href="/#ContactMe">contact form</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy {
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .privacy h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
  }

  .privacy h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .privacy table {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .privacy th,
  .privacy td {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--site-border);
  }

  .privacy th {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* A long page of text: no hover lift */
  .card.privacy:hover {
    transform: none;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
</style>
